content.text:
The survey's largest shifts are mostly load falling away, not new errors. The one new failure is the route-service restart, which is what ui-dashboard's `routes` calls depend on.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-route-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name AS pod, metric, count(*) AS n, min(value) AS mn, max(value) AS mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name='ts-route-service-664768585b-zpghc' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "The ts-route-service container restart counter is 1 for the whole abnormal window, while the normal baseline has no restart increments."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT time, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name='ts-route-service-664768585b-zpghc' AND metric='k8s.pod.memory.usage' ORDER BY time LIMIT 10",
          "claim": "Route-service pod memory falls from about 839 MB to about 2 MB at the restart (around 04:22:34) and stays near zero."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' AS p, count(*) AS server_spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' UNION ALL SELECT 'nor', count(*) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server'",
          "claim": "ts-route-service serves only a handful of server spans in the abnormal window versus hundreds of normal spans."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-route-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_http_response_status_code AS code, count(*) AS n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name='GET /api/v1/routeservice/routes' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "118 of 141 ui-dashboard GET routes calls returned 503 after about 3.5 s, while the normal period had no errors on this path."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

